# Shadowrocket AI supplemental rules
# Maintained by coutureone/Shadowrocket
# Updated: 2026-08-24
#
# Purpose: keep authentication, session, API, static assets and region checks
# for Gemini / ChatGPT on the same AI policy. Google AI session dependencies
# are intentionally kept together so region checks use one proxy exit.

# Gemini web, API and authentication dependencies
DOMAIN,accounts.google.com
DOMAIN,oauth2.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,www.google.com
DOMAIN,ogs.google.com
DOMAIN,play.google.com
DOMAIN,people-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,waa-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,assistant-s3-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,optimizationguide-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apis.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativeai.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,proactivebackend-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,generativelanguage

# ChatGPT web/app, authentication, challenges and realtime dependencies
DOMAIN,browser-intake-datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,chat.openai.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN,openai-api.arkoselabs.com
DOMAIN,static.cloudflareinsights.com
